# Superstore Data Mart & Power BI Data Model

## 📌 Overview

This project demonstrates the design and implementation of an end-to-end data mart using the Superstore dataset.

## 🧱 Data Modeling

* Designed a star schema with a central fact table and multiple dimension tables:

  * Customer Dimension
  * Product Dimension
  * Geography Dimension
  * Segment Dimension
  * Date Dimension

## ⚙️ Data Processing

* Performed data transformation and cleaning using SQL
* Created dimension tables ensuring unique keys
* Built a structured fact table for sales analytics

## 📊 Visualization

* Developed Power BI dashboards for:

  * Sales performance
  * Profit analysis
  * Customer segmentation
  * Regional trends

## 🧠 Key Concepts Used

* Star Schema Design
* Data Modeling
* SQL Transformations
* DAX Calculations
* BI Reporting

## 🛠 Tools & Technologies

* Snowflake / SQL
* Power BI
* DAX
* Data Modeling

